                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "God old HOG. It has the usual features, with one little extra game play element. The Hint would only give you a hint if you were in the scene where you could do something like many of the older games. It didn't bother me, though. I didn't get stuck very often at all. I don't think it had a fast travel map, but I didn't miss it.\r\n\r\nThe mini-games were quite creative. And I only skipped maybe three of them.\r\n\r\nIt says I played for 3 hours. It felt longer than that. If it's truly only 3-4 hours, then definitely get it on a discount. I don't think this one was pricy to begin with.",
